{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06783","headline":"小敷谷龙潭祠作 · 王昌龄","name":"小敷谷龙潭祠作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崖谷歕疾流，地中有雷集。\n百泉势相荡，巨石皆却立。\n跳波沸峥嵘，深处不可挹。\n昏爲蛟龙怒，清见云雨入。\n灵怪祟偏祠，废兴自兹邑。\n沈淫顷多昧，檐宇遂不葺。\n吾闻被明典，盛德惟世及。\n生人载山川，血食报原隰。\n岂伊骇微险，将以循甿揖。\n口飞振吕梁，忠信亦我习。\n波流浸已广，悔吝在所汲。\n谿水有清源，褰裳靡沾湿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}